    REVIEWING --> ACCEPTED : guard chỉ chặn khi đã ACCEPTED
    REVIEWING --> REJECTED : guard chỉ chặn khi đã ACCEPTED

    REJECTED --> ACCEPTED : code cho phép, accept chỉ từ chối khi status = ACCEPTED

    ACCEPTED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]

